> Live demo link pending — `[ADD LIVE DEMO URL]`

<br/>

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| 🧩 Interactive Periodic Table | Click and explore every element in a fully interactive layout |
| 🔍 Element Exploration | Browse elements by category, group, and period |
| 📋 Element Information | View detailed data for each chemical element |
| 📱 Responsive Design | Seamless experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile |
| 🎨 Modern UI | Clean, minimal, visually polished interface |
| ⚡ Lightweight Architecture | Built with vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — no bloated dependencies |

**Project Structure**

```text
ELEMENTA----The-Periodic-Table/
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── script.js
└── data.js
```

